      "text": "Ohio\u2019s state-funded universities face an enrollment cliff, tuition is going up, and the value of a college degree is going down. We can\u2019t ignore the problem & I\u2019ve offered an actual solution to fix it, while my opponent @amyactonoh offers what she always does: absolutely nothing.\nMy piece in the Columbus Dispatch this week:\n\nThe race for governor of Ohio can be a positive opportunity to give voters a choice between competing policy visions for our state \u2013 and to have a healthy debate about the r",
