    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Doctor, mother, wife, leader. I\u2019m lucky to have married her, and Ohio will be lucky to have her as our next First Lady.\n\nVideo",
