    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Proud to support our men &amp; women in uniform, and I\u2019m grateful for the vote of confidence from sheriffs across the state. We\u2019ve got your back. \ud83d\ude4f\n\nVideo",
