      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The fastest way to make life more affordable in Ohio is by attracting more high-paying jobs to our state. That requires slashing property taxes, eliminating the income tax to compete with states like TX & FL, cutting red tape & speeding up permitting timelines. That starts in January after we win.",
